 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Sandwiches, salads, pastries, and fruit are good ones. Keep sandwiches in bag and eat them at a cafe. Yes, tough one. Keep it warm in a blanket bag if you can. Otherwise, pitch it in bin and get fresh cut. Definitely. Stick to the non-refrigerated ones. Put it in cool spot, away from direct light. A small ice chest helps if it' warm outside. Pop a bag of sweets in your bag as well. People always want something sweet on a picnic.",
